    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="4a139bc8-b98b-558b-8c13-5bc30ca438b7" activityNameId="af41ec04-67bc-502c-a4af-5b8bba8fee24" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Infrastructure, sewage heat pump 140kW, for heat pump calculation</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Infrastructure, sewage heat pump 140kW, for heat pump calculation
Heat at heat pump without heat distribution. A life time of 20 years has been assumed for the heat pump.;
UUID: 5848bac1-d852-3eba-b3d8-e2bb70f76259
Includes infrastucture and electricity (Swiss electricity mix) for heat pump. Includes emissions of refrigerant (R134a) during operation. Heat at heat pump, i.e. heat distribution in the house is not included. Infrastructure extrapolated from brine-water heat pump using a correction factor.
Location: Operation in Switzerland (i.e. Swiss electricity mix)
Technology: Based on average SPF2 (Seasonal Performance Factor, including auxiliary energy) of air-water heat pumps installed in year 1998 operating in Switzerland.
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: statistics 
Extrapolations: see Geography/Text
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_5848bac1-d852-3eba-b3d8-e2bb70f76259.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
